.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-doctor 1  "ifg-doctor 0.9.0"
.SH NAME
ifg\-doctor \- Check the whole setup: host, token, scopes, server version, streaming
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg doctor\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the whole setup: host, token, scopes, server version, streaming
.PP
Answers "why does this command fail" without a debugging session, and exits 1 when something is actually broken (warnings do not fail).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
